      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        96,
        -64
      ],
      "webhookId": "bc849ab7-e95e-40ae-b365-b9f02ac54402",
      "notes": "Receives edited product data from web app for saving to database.\n\nExpected payload:\n{\n  \"productName\": \"string\",\n  \"brand\": \"string\",\n  \"category\": \"string\",\n  \"subCategory\": \"string\",\n  \"expiryDate\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"mrp\": \"string\",\n  \"weight\": \"string\",\n  \"ingredients\": \"string\",\n  \"nutrition\": {...},\n  \"healthScore\": number,\n  \"healthRating\": \"string\",\n  \"concerns\": \"string\",\n  \"quantity\": number\n}"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Prepare data for Supabase insert - fix type mismatches\nconst items = [];\n\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const data = item.json;\n  \n  // Convert nutrition object to JSON string for TEXT field\n  const nutritionString = data.nutrition ? JSON.stringify(data.nutrition) : null;\n  \n  // Convert concerns array to newline-separated string for TEXT field\n  const concernsString = Array.isArray(data.concerns) && data.concerns.length > 0\n    ? data.concerns.join('\\n')\n    : null;\n  \n  // Ensure health_score fits NUMERIC(3,1) constraint (max 99.9)\n  let healthScore = data.healthScore || 0;\n  if (healthScore > 99.9) {\n    healthScore = 99.9;\n  }\n  if (healthScore < 0) {\n    healthScore = 0;\n  }\n  // Round to 1 decimal place\n  healthScore = Math.round(healthScore * 10) / 10;\n  \n  items.push({\n    json: {\n      ...data,\n      // Override with database-compatible formats\n      nutritionalInfo: nutritionString,\n      concernsText: concernsString,\n      healthScore: healthScore\n    },\n    pairedItem: { item: 0 }\n  });\n}\n\nreturn items;"
      },
      "id": "6daaf7a2-ee45-4cf1-a637-6680acc90999",
      "name": "Prepare for Database",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        320,
        -64
      ],
      "notes": "Transforms data types to match Supabase schema:\n\n- nutrition object → JSON string (TEXT)\n- concerns array → newline-separated string (TEXT)\n- health_score capped at 99.9 (NUMERIC(3,1))\n- Handles null values safely"
    },
    {
